OL,3,GNEWSAMother whose son died of a tumour
OL,4,Awelcomes change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose son died of a brain
OL,7,Ftumour has welcomed government plans to
OL,8,Fspeed up research into the disease.
OL,10,FEllie Thompson's son Billy passed away
OL,11,Fwhen he was four years old from an
OL,12,Faggressive brain tumour.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday elite Scottish swimmer
OL,15,FArchie Goodburn, who was diagnosed with
OL,16,Finoperable brain tumours two years ago,
OL,17,Fmet Prime Minister Andy Burnham to
OL,18,Fdiscuss funding.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
